use libfuzzer_sys::fuzz_target;

fuzz_target!(|data: &[u8]| {
    let _ = serde_json::from_slice::<serde_json::Value>(data);
});
```

## Fuzzing Strategies

### Strategy 1: Raw Bytes to Struct

```rust
fuzz_target!(|data: &[u8]| {
    // Directly pass raw bytes to a decoder
    if let Ok((rest, message)) = decode_message(data) {
        // Only continue if parsing succeeded
        let encoded = encode_message(&message);
        assert_eq!(encoded, data[..data.len() - rest.len()]);
    }
});
```

### Strategy 2: Targeted Mutation

Use `arbitrary` crate for structured fuzzing:

```rust
